to get the trajectory used follow this link https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PekiBfUHCiyHV3Z3gif3y77XG5hy4SB7/view?usp=sharing

run bintest.py to generate the changes to the free energy curve for all single mutations in results/

then run process_results.py to convert those to the predicted changes in binding energy

matrix_bar*.py will let you visualize them all simultaneously

you can also run onestruct.py to get the energies for just one structure

one_matrix_bar*.py will let you visulaize them
